# The verification programs the wasm target cannot run (OpenSpec change wasm-console; spec testing/golden-corpus,
# "The wasm known list"), in the format of known.list: <name><TAB><reason>. Every reason starts with target,
# float, clib, width, node, varies or open. The lines target are skipped without a build.
# They were written by `-z --target wasm` over the suite (task 6.2 of wasm-console): target for one that uses a word
# the target does not have, or a part of libqb it does not build yet. The reason offset, for a program rejected for
# a pointer's size, went with the OpenSpec change wasm-pointer-width (2026-11-20): _OFFSET, _MEM and a member array
# of strings are built with 4-byte pointers. The reason window, for a program without $CONSOLE:ONLY, went with the
# OpenSpec change wasm-window (2026-11-21): such a program runs in a page, in headless Chrome.
# target: 185
